  "protocol": "Sequential fresh workers, rotating method order. One hash verification, two warmups, three timed request batches per worker. Median of worker medians, natural GC. Counting Node writable; no disk or HTTP delivery. Whole-process peak RSS includes imports, connection setup, verification and warmups. Same 64 KiB flush target and 2048-row yields. ZIP level 1, memLevel 9, 256 KiB chunks. Plain CSV matches csv-stringify exactly and independently parses to fixture values. ZIP hashes match table/manual/library methods; query ZIP differs by entry name. Query planning and statement preparation included in time; connection/import setup excluded. Full SQLite aggregation is deliberately excluded because CSV production must remain streaming."
